  "details": "This is noticable and the only fix is switching to an avatar with full lip sync visemes and to switch back to the avatar with jaw flap bone or blend shape for it to work.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Switch to an avatar with full lip sync setup\n2. Switch to an avatar with Jaw Flap Bone or Blend Shape\n3. Should animate locally in a mirror just fine.\n4. Switch to any world\n5. Go to a mirror in the world and tada, mouth doesnt animate in mirror until you repeat steps 1-3 again, which would annoy some people.",
